{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"e2fce7d27c98bc7d","children":[{"parent":"9a7a6790e60a2aef","children":[],"id":"1ebf445b4814b1ee","title":"之前使用的fopen就是这个类型的文件流。它是有一个缓冲区的（就是一块内存，这块内存在用户空间）。<br>"},{"parent":"9a7a6790e60a2aef","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold"},"id":"c9dbd95ace9d3488","title":"凡是需要涉及读磁盘，都需要经过内核。这时候就有一个&nbsp;从&nbsp;用户态到内核态的转换。这个转换非常耗费性能。<br>所以我们想尽可能减少这种状态转换"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"9a7a6790e60a2aef","title":"有缓冲文件流"},{"parent":"e2fce7d27c98bc7d","children":[{"parent":"cce78de4bdbc2f83","children":[],"id":"a33eaa506b89a179","title":"在用户空间，没有缓冲区。&nbsp;我们每一次读的数据，都是从内核态取出来的"}],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"cce78de4bdbc2f83","title":"无缓冲文件流"},{"parent":"e2fce7d27c98bc7d","children":[],"id":"12eeaae39c3c2b00","title":"流程也非常重要，数据是怎么流的，这个才是重点"}],"style":{"font-size":"18px"},"id":"e2fce7d27c98bc7d","title":"概述"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"7c646de7e8f55255","children":[{"parent":"13842575c42aa042","children":[{"parent":"fa7a5532e8fdde10","children":[],"id":"c23046353b7a461a","title":"int open(const char *pathname, int flags);<br>int open(const char *pathname, int flags, mode_t mode);"},{"parent":"fa7a5532e8fdde10","children":[{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"d611c3ff3c86fd03","title":"使用宏定义来表示含义。宏定义其实是使用的特定的某一位来标识含义。<br>大家使用这些宏定义组合的时候，使用 |"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"c57c378e4d72313d","title":"O_RDONLY"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"2461f01cc7c7a65a","title":"O_WRONLY"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"031f2f7044695244","title":"O_RDWR"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"39899cd0fa341aa9","title":"O_CREAT"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"97e038cee2110713","title":"O_TRUNC"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[],"id":"749339a3c6ad4d3f","title":"O_APPEND"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[{"parent":"7d16e01444ac0bdf","children":[],"id":"5ac45423ee307b53","title":"这个就是独占。文件不存在，创建。文件存在报错。&nbsp;"}],"id":"7d16e01444ac0bdf","title":"O_EXCL"},{"parent":"bf0f27353e6ce004","children":[{"parent":"5b7855547c0e9c0e","children":[],"id":"9c57f0bbcdaf7e43","title":"r: O_RDONLY"},{"parent":"5b7855547c0e9c0e","children":[],"id":"c373dd75c65b31f1","title":"w: O_WRONLY | O_CREAT | O_TRUNC<br>如果要创建，一定要记得加权限。&nbsp;"}],"id":"5b7855547c0e9c0e","title":"把一些重点的记一下"}],"id":"bf0f27353e6ce004","title":"flags：&nbsp;打开的模式。"}],"id":"fa7a5532e8fdde10","title":"open"}],"id":"13842575c42aa042","title":"打开流"},{"parent":"7c646de7e8f55255","children":[{"parent":"e59b0a91afa7bd86","children":[{"parent":"f9e26442e07f6ccc","children":[],"id":"7c5985acd30f6854","title":"读数据。"}],"id":"f9e26442e07f6ccc","title":"read"},{"parent":"e59b0a91afa7bd86","children":[{"parent":"8ae28860749bd67b","children":[],"id":"4932ccedc9d85769","title":"写数据"}],"id":"8ae28860749bd67b","title":"write"}],"id":"e59b0a91afa7bd86","title":"使用流"},{"parent":"7c646de7e8f55255","children":[{"parent":"ea20dcba599e4f48","children":[],"id":"34e9a66039a65537","title":"close&nbsp;"}],"id":"ea20dcba599e4f48","title":"关闭流"},{"parent":"7c646de7e8f55255","children":[{"parent":"841cfeb0088ffc9f","children":[],"id":"db59bb00df2892ea","title":"可以使用计时器获取当前的ms。&nbsp;然后对比一下，数组的大小，对于文本复制的速度是否有影响"},{"parent":"841cfeb0088ffc9f","children":[],"id":"af37ba5bdf63d22d","title":"100&nbsp;速度就会比较慢。&nbsp;但是1000 2000 4000&nbsp;"}],"id":"841cfeb0088ffc9f","title":"文本复制的时候"}],"id":"7c646de7e8f55255","title":"使用"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"dfcf89c99cda3521","children":[{"parent":"fbb1c4c48e765627","children":[],"id":"0b56b9fdf15dbecc","title":"用于改变一个已经打开的文件的大小。&nbsp;比如可以让它大点。让它小点"},{"parent":"fbb1c4c48e765627","children":[],"id":"d18c19a2d15c388e","title":"有啥用：&nbsp;主要用于占位。&nbsp;在一些下载的场景中，我们会事先用 ftruncate&nbsp;占指定大小。&nbsp;用来保证<br>先把磁盘空间占上，不会下载到一半，才发现，空间不足"}],"id":"fbb1c4c48e765627","title":"ftruncate&nbsp;"}],"id":"dfcf89c99cda3521","title":"特殊的函数"}],"root":true,"theme":"theme_wps_def","showWatermark":false,"id":"root","title":"无缓冲文件流","version":106,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:34:40","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}